# Charmbracelet VHS tape for adversarial-skeptic real-world usecase
# Run: vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1200
Set Height 780
Set LineHeight 1.2
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Type "npm run demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 12s
